+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Edit a module that another module imports statically, and check that the importer shows the new value while its transform count stays at 1 (playground/hmr/__tests__/hmr.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+
+## 2. Module graph
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Record the statically imported urls of each module next to its imported modules (packages/vite/src/node/server/moduleGraph.ts, packages/vite/src/node/plugins/importAnalysis.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Soft-invalidate an importer that imports the changed module statically, keeping its previous transform result; hard-invalidate every other importer (packages/vite/src/node/server/moduleGraph.ts)
+
+## 3. Transform
+
+- [ ] 3.1 Serve a soft-invalidated module from its previous transform result with the import timestamps updated (packages/vite/src/node/server/transformRequest.ts)
